{"id":"community-tiptap-text-editor","title":"A rich-text editor with a toolbar and local drafts","description":"The larger companion to the single-button component: a `Static Data` node holds the list of toolbar commands, a `For Each` draws one button per entry, and the editor itself is mounted by a `JavaScriptFunction` onto a `Group`'s element. Two details are worth more than the editor. The draft is saved to `localStorage` on a `Timer` and read back on mount, which is the whole of 'don't lose my work' and costs two function nodes. And `Model2` plus `SetModelProperties` keep the document in the project's own data model rather than only inside the third-party editor, so something other than the editor can read what was typed. ⚠️ The toolbar is driven by data, so adding a command is a row in the `Static Data` node — not a new button.","demonstrates":["Boolean","CSS Definition","For Each","Group","JavaScriptFunction","Model2","SetModelProperties","States","Static Data","String","Text","Timer","net.noodl.controls.button"],"components":[{"name":"Tiptap text editor","nodes":[{"id":"group","type":"Group","parameters":{"backgroundColor":"Grey - 900","minHeight":{"value":100,"unit":"vh"},"alignItems":"flex-start","paddingLeft":"var(--space-4)","paddingTop":"var(--space-4)","paddingBottom":"var(--space-4)","paddingRight":"var(--space-4)","rowGap":"var(--space-4)"},"children":["menu","group-2","outputs"]},{"id":"menu","type":"Group","label":"Menu","parent":"group","parameters":{"flexDirection":"row","columnGap":"var(--space-2-5)","sizeMode":"contentSize","backgroundColor":"7%"},"children":["for-each"]},{"id":"for-each","type":"For Each","parent":"menu","parameters":{"template":"/#Experiments/experiments/Tiptap editor/Editor button"}},{"id":"group-2","type":"Group","parent":"group","parameters":{"paddingLeft":"var(--space-4)","paddingTop":"var(--space-4)","paddingBottom":"var(--space-4)","paddingRight":"var(--space-4)","backgroundColor":"7%","borderStyle":"solid","borderWidth":{"value":1,"unit":"px"},"borderColor":"7%","borderRadius":{"value":8,"unit":"px"},"sizeMode":"contentHeight"},"children":["tiptap-editor"]},{"id":"tiptap-editor","type":"Group","label":"Tiptap Editor","parent":"group-2","parameters":{"sizeMode":"contentHeight"}},{"id":"outputs","type":"Group","label":"Outputs","parent":"group","parameters":{"flexDirection":"row","marginLeft":"var(--space-0)","columnGap":"var(--space-2)"},"children":["group-3","group-5"]},{"id":"group-3","type":"Group","parent":"outputs","children":["group-4","text-2"]},{"id":"group-4","type":"Group","parent":"group-3","parameters":{"flexDirection":"row","columnGap":"var(--space-2)","alignY":"center","alignX":"center"},"children":["text","button"]},{"id":"text","type":"Text","parent":"group-4","parameters":{"text":"HTML Output","color":"Grey - 600","sizeMode":"contentSize"}},{"id":"button","type":"net.noodl.controls.button","parent":"group-4","parameters":{"alignY":"center"}},{"id":"text-2","type":"Text","parent":"group-3","parameters":{"fontFamily":"Courier New","color":"Grey - 300"}},{"id":"group-5","type":"Group","parent":"outputs","children":["plain-text","text-3"]},{"id":"plain-text","type":"Text","label":"Plain Text","parent":"group-5","parameters":{"text":"Plain Text
","color":"Grey - 600"}},{"id":"text-3","type":"Text","parent":"group-5","parameters":{"fontFamily":"Courier New","color":"Grey - 300"}},{"id":"create-text-editor","type":"JavaScriptFunction","label":"Create Text Editor","parameters":{"functionScript":"
const editorContent = Inputs.EditorContent || '<p>nothing</p>';
const editorOptions = Noodl.Objects[Inputs.EditorOptions] || {};
const editorDiv = Inputs.EditorDiv.getDOMElement()

try {
  const { Editor } = await import('https://esm.sh/@tiptap/core');
  const { StarterKit } = await import('https://esm.sh/@tiptap/starter-kit');

  const options = {
    content: editorContent,
    element: editorDiv,
    autofocus: editorOptions.autofocus || true,
    editable: editorOptions.editable || true,
    injectCSS: editorOptions.injectCSS || false,
    onUpdate({ editor }) {
      Outputs.ContentUpdated()
    },
