// The grown-ups' changes to the game's rows: what a change may say, and how the saved changes become applyRows' `over`.
//
// checkChange is the one rule book. The cloud functions "Grown-ups/Save Change" and "Grown-ups/Remove Change" carry a
// copy of the text between the two CHECKCHANGE markers (script files do not run in cloud functions yet), and
// tests/rows-guard.test.mjs fails if the two copies ever differ. The server refuses whatever it says no to; the game
// asks it again before applying a saved change, so a row that reached the database some other way is still skipped.

// ---- CHECKCHANGE BEGIN ----
function checkChange(table, rowId, fields) {
